art-btn\">Restart</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"panel-section controls-section\">\n        <strong>Controls</strong>\n        <div class=\"controls-list\">\n          <span>\u2191\u2193</span><span>Move up/down</span>\n          <span>\u2192</span><span>Soft drop (left side)</span>\n          <span>\u2190</span><span>Soft drop (right side)</span>\n          <span>Z / X</span><span>Rotate CCW / CW</span>\n          <span>Space</span><span>Hard drop</span>\n          <span>P</span><span>Pause / Resume</span>\n          <span>R</span><span>Restart</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <script src=\"game.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"render.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
