The clearLines fix looks correct. Let me verify the logic mentally:

- Left side: cols 0-11, wall at col 11. Farthest from wall = col 0. Sort ascending (0,1,2...). When we clear col X (shift cols 0..X-1 rightward by 1), the remaining full columns at higher indices (Y > X) are unaffected since we only shifted cols < X. ✓
